<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-grid hero-grid--focused">
<div class="hero-left">
<p class="hero-eyebrow">BEST PRODUCT PICKS FOR REAL BUYERS - BACKED BY RELIABILITY SIGNALS AND BUYER PATTERNS</p>
<h1>Best products. One clear decision.</h1>
<div class="hero-buttons">
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="#quick-shop">Find your product</a>
</div>
<p class="hero-helper">Start with the product you are actually shopping for, then move straight to the decision and the proof behind it. For blenders, the best pick for most people is the Vitamix 5200.</p>
<p class="home-brand-proofline">Choosimple gives you one clear decision — based on real ownership patterns, not review noise or spec-sheet overload.</p>
</div>
<div class="hero-right">
<div class="featured-rotation-stack" aria-live="polite">
{% for item in categories %}{% if item.featured %}
<a aria-label="View details for {{ item.decision }}" class="hero-card hero-card--featured-link featured-rotation-card{% if loop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" href="{{ item.url }}">
<p class="hero-card-eyebrow">Choosimple featured decision</p>
<div class="featured-image-wrap">
<img alt="{{ item.imageAlt }}" class="featured-image" src="{{ item.image }}"/>
</div>
<h3>{{ item.decision }}</h3>
<p class="hero-card-sub">{{ item.featuredSub }}</p>
<div class="hero-card-rule"></div>
<p class="hero-card-quote">{{ item.featuredQuote }}</p>
<p class="hero-card-proof">{{ item.featuredProof | safe }}</p>
<p class="hero-card-note">Want a different category? Start with the buttons on the left.</p>
</a>
{% endif %}{% endfor %}
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section><section class="quick-shop" id="quick-shop">
<div class="quick-shop-inner">
<div class="quick-shop-copy">
<span class="eyebrow">Start here</span>
<h2>What are you shopping for?</h2>
</div>
